{"seq":2,"slug":"biological-psychology","title":"生物心理学与神经科学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.36,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生物心理学与神经科学-简介\">生物心理学与神经科学 简介</h1><p>生物心理学是心理学与神经科学的交叉领域，它从分子、细胞、回路和系统等多个层次探究行为与心理活动的生物学基础。从一个神经元如何发放电信号，到整个大脑如何协调产生意识体验，生物心理学试图回答一个根本问题：物质的大脑如何产生主观的心灵？</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对&quot;脑与行为&quot;关系感兴趣的读者，尤其适合具有一定心理学基础、希望深入理解神经科学前沿的学习者。无论你是心理学专业学生、临床工作者，还是对脑科学抱有好奇心的技术从业者，都能在这里找到系统的知识框架和实际应用的桥梁。</p>\n<p>全书分为四章，从基础到应用层层递进。第1章<strong>神经科学基础</strong>聚焦于神经系统的核心运作机制，包括神经信号传导、脑成像技术、神经可塑性和大脑偏侧化，帮助读者建立对大脑结构与功能的整体认知。第2章<strong>神经心理学</strong>转向脑损伤与行为的关系，探讨神经系统疾病、认知康复策略以及神经心理评估方法，为理解脑功能障碍提供临床视角。第3章<strong>精神药理学</strong>深入药物与大脑的交互作用，涵盖药物作用机制、抗抑郁与抗焦虑药物、精神兴奋剂以及近年来备受关注的迷幻药研究，揭示化学物质如何塑造心理状态。第4章<strong>睡眠与意识</strong>探索人类最基本又最神秘的心理现象，从睡眠分期、睡眠障碍、昼夜节律到意识状态的多元层次，帮助读者理解清醒与沉睡之间的生物学边界。</p>\n<p>推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读：先掌握神经科学基础的核心概念，再通过神经心理学理解脑功能与行为的对应关系，接着学习精神药理学来了解化学调控的原理，最后在睡眠与意识章节中将所有知识融合，思考大脑如何在不同状态之间切换。如果你对某一特定主题有紧迫的学习需求，也可以直接跳转到相应章节，每章都提供了独立可读的知识框架。</p>\n<p>学习过程中建议将理论知识与日常观察结合起来。例如，在学习神经可塑性时，可以反思自己学习新技能时大脑发生了怎样的变化；在学习睡眠科学时，可以审视自己的作息习惯并尝试优化。这种&quot;学以致用&quot;的方式将大幅提升学习效果，也是生物心理学最迷人的地方——它让我们用科学的眼光重新认识自己。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neuroscience-foundations","title":"神经科学基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuroscience-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-communication","title":"神经信号传导机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuroscience-foundations/neural-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brain-imaging","title":"脑成像技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuroscience-foundations/brain-imaging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neuroplasticity","title":"神经可塑性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuroscience-foundations/neuroplasticity"},{"seq":4,"slug":"lateralization","title":"大脑偏侧化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuroscience-foundations/lateralization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"neuropsychology","title":"神经心理学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuropsychology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brain-damage-behavior","title":"脑损伤与行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuropsychology/brain-damage-behavior"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neurological-disorders","title":"神经系统疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuropsychology/neurological-disorders"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-rehabilitation","title":"认知康复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuropsychology/cognitive-rehabilitation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"neuropsychological-assessment","title":"神经心理评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/neuropsychology/neuropsychological-assessment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"psychopharmacology","title":"精神药理学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/psychopharmacology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-mechanisms","title":"药物作用机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/psychopharmacology/drug-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"antidepressants-anxiolytics","title":"抗抑郁药与抗焦虑药","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/psychopharmacology/antidepressants-anxiolytics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"psychostimulants","title":"精神兴奋剂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/psychopharmacology/psychostimulants"},{"seq":4,"slug":"psychedelics-research","title":"迷幻药研究前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/psychopharmacology/psychedelics-research"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sleep-and-consciousness","title":"睡眠与意识","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/sleep-and-consciousness","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-stages","title":"睡眠分期与睡眠结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/sleep-and-consciousness/sleep-stages"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-disorders","title":"睡眠障碍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/sleep-and-consciousness/sleep-disorders"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circadian-rhythms","title":"昼夜节律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/sleep-and-consciousness/circadian-rhythms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"consciousness-states","title":"意识状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/biological-psychology/sleep-and-consciousness/consciousness-states"}]}]}